{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "ogs-0.4.schema.json",
  "title": "OpenGeoSlide model (.ogs.json) v0.4",
  "description": "Formato de modelo v0.4 (briefs/00_CONTRATOS.md §1, briefs/01_CONTRATOS_FASE1.md F1.1, briefs/02_CONTRATOS_FASE3.md F3.1 y briefs/03_CONTRATOS_REFUERZOS.md F4.1 y F4.2). Admite version 0.1, 0.2, 0.3 y 0.4. Con version 0.1, loads solo puede ser [] y analysis.seismic solo null o ausente (igual que ogs-core); el resto de usos de loads y seismic exigen version 0.2 o posterior. Cada campo o variante nueva de la Fase 3a exige version 0.3: model \"undrained\", los campos undrained_strength, strength_datum, strength_gradient y strength_limit, surface.type \"polyline\", los métodos morgenstern_price, janbu_simplified y janbu_corrected, y analysis.interslice (un valor null cuenta como ausente, igual que en ogs-core). La lista reinforcements (anchor, nail, geosynthetic, pile y sheet_pile) exige version 0.4: con una versión menor solo puede ser [] (null no se admite, igual que loads). Las cotas son las de briefs/00_CONTRATOS.md §4.5 y las del motor: el esquema y el binario ogs aceptan y rechazan los mismos documentos, salvo las reglas que JSON Schema no puede expresar y valida solo el motor: material de cada región existente, ids de material y de carga únicos, x1 < x2 en cada udl, x de cada carga dentro del rango del modelo, polígonos simples sin solapes ni áreas degeneradas, piezométrica con x estrictamente creciente, rangos entry/exit con lo ≤ hi y dentro del modelo, n_entry·n_exit·n_radius ≤ 2 000 000, x estrictamente creciente (con separación de al menos 1e-9 por el ancho del modelo) en analysis.surface de tipo polyline, los puntos de interslice.data_points (ξ estrictamente creciente de 0 a 1, f ≥ 0 y algún f > 0), y, en reinforcements, los ids únicos, la longitud mayor que 0, x1 = x2 en sheet_pile y pullout.bonded_length ≤ longitud del elemento. Las unidades no se convierten: deben ser coherentes entre sí. Los ángulos van en grados.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "format",
    "version",
    "materials",
    "regions",
    "analysis"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "const": "0.1"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "loads": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 0
          },
          "analysis": {
            "properties": {
              "seismic": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Versiones 0.1 y 0.2: ningún campo de la Fase 3a (un null cuenta como ausente).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "enum": [
              "0.1",
              "0.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "materials": {
            "items": {
              "properties": {
                "model": {
                  "const": "mohr_coulomb"
                },
                "undrained_strength": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "strength_datum": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "strength_gradient": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "strength_limit": {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "analysis": {
            "properties": {
              "methods": {
                "items": {
                  "enum": [
                    "bishop",
                    "spencer"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "interslice": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "surface": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  },
                  {
                    "properties": {
                      "type": {
                        "const": "circle"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Versiones 0.1, 0.2 y 0.3: reinforcements solo puede ser [] (E14a).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "enum": [
              "0.1",
              "0.2",
              "0.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "reinforcements": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 0
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "properties": {
    "format": {
      "const": "opengeoslide"
    },
    "version": {
      "enum": [
        "0.1",
        "0.2",
        "0.3",
        "0.4"
      ]
    },
    "meta": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/meta"
    },
    "units": {
      "description": "Convencionalmente \"SI\" o \"imperial\". ogs-core acepta cualquier cadena (o null) y no convierte unidades.",
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ],
      "examples": [
        "SI",
        "imperial"
      ]
    },
    "materials": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/material"
      }
    },
    "regions": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/region"
      }
    },
    "water": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/water"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ]
    },
    "loads": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/loads"
    },
    "reinforcements": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/reinforcements"
    },
    "slope": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/slope"
    },
    "analysis": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/analysis"
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "point": {
      "type": "array",
      "prefixItems": [
        {
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "type": "number"
        }
      ],
      "items": false,
      "minItems": 2,
      "maxItems": 2
    },
    "range": {
      "description": "Rango [min, max] en x.",
      "type": "array",
      "prefixItems": [
        {
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "type": "number"
        }
      ],
      "items": false,
      "minItems": 2,
      "maxItems": 2
    },
    "polyline": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 2,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
      }
    },
    "polygon": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 3,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/point"
      }
    },
    "meta": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "title": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "material": {
      "description": "Los campos que exige o prohíbe cada model (F3.2): mohr_coulomb exige cohesion y friction_angle y prohíbe los cuatro campos no drenados; undrained exige undrained_strength y prohíbe cohesion y friction_angle. strength_datum (una cota, no una profundidad) y strength_gradient van juntos o no van; strength_limit solo se admite con strength_gradient. Un null cuenta como campo ausente (igual que en ogs-core). El modelo undrained exige version 0.3.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name",
        "model",
        "unit_weight"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "model": {
          "enum": [
            "mohr_coulomb",
            "undrained"
          ]
        },
        "unit_weight": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "unit_weight_sat": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "cohesion": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "friction_angle": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0,
          "exclusiveMaximum": 90
        },
        "ru": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0,
          "exclusiveMaximum": 1
        },
        "undrained_strength": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "strength_datum": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "strength_gradient": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "strength_limit": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "model": {
                "const": "mohr_coulomb"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "cohesion",
              "friction_angle"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "cohesion": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "friction_angle": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "undrained_strength": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "strength_datum": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "strength_gradient": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "strength_limit": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "model": {
                "const": "undrained"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "undrained_strength"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "undrained_strength": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "cohesion": {
                "type": "null"
              },
              "friction_angle": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            },
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "required": [
                  "strength_datum",
                  "strength_gradient"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "strength_datum": {
                    "type": "number"
                  },
                  "strength_gradient": {
                    "type": "number"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "properties": {
                  "strength_datum": {
                    "type": "null"
                  },
                  "strength_gradient": {
                    "type": "null"
                  },
                  "strength_limit": {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "region": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "material",
        "polygon"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "material": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "polygon": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/polygon"
        }
      }
    },
    "water": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "unit_weight": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "default": 9.81
        },
        "piezometric_line": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/polyline"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "loads": {
      "description": "Cargas superficiales (solo version 0.2). Por defecto, lista vacía.",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/udl"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/line_load"
          }
        ]
      },
      "default": []
    },
    "udl": {
      "description": "Carga distribuida vertical q (kPa; psf en unidades imperiales) sobre el terreno entre x1 y x2 (x1 < x2, ambos dentro del rango x del modelo).",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "type",
        "x1",
        "x2",
        "q"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "udl"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "x1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "x2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "q": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "line_load": {
      "description": "Carga lineal p (kN/m; lbf/ft en unidades imperiales) aplicada en (x, y_top(x)). angle en grados desde la vertical hacia abajo; el positivo inclina la carga hacia +x del modelo.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "type",
        "x",
        "p"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "line"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "x": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "p": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "angle": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": -90,
          "maximum": 90,
          "default": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "reinforcements": {
      "description": "Refuerzos (solo version 0.4). Por defecto, lista vacía; ids únicos (solo el motor lo valida).",
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/tension_element"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/pile"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/sheet_pile"
          }
        ]
      },
      "default": []
    },
    "tension_element": {
      "description": "anchor, nail o geosynthetic (F4.2): segmento de la cabeza (x1, y1) a la punta (x2, y2), de longitud mayor que 0. Las capacidades van por elemento; spacing (por defecto 1) las pasa a fuerza por metro de talud. application y direction son obligatorios. Un null cuenta como campo ausente.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "type",
        "x1",
        "y1",
        "x2",
        "y2",
        "application",
        "tensile_capacity",
        "direction"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "anchor",
            "nail",
            "geosynthetic"
          ]
        },
        "x1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "x2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "application": {
          "enum": [
            "active",
            "passive"
          ]
        },
        "tensile_capacity": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "end1_capacity": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "end2_capacity": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "spacing": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "direction": {
          "enum": [
            "axial",
            "tangent",
            "bisector"
          ]
        },
        "pullout": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/pullout"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "pile": {
      "description": "pile (F4.2): pilote o micropilote con fuerza de corte constante por pilote (force, ≥ 0) y spacing (por defecto 1). La cabeza (x1, y1) es el extremo superior; longitud mayor que 0. direction angle exige angle en (−90, 90), medido sobre la horizontal (0 es horizontal); con tangent y perpendicular angle está prohibido.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "type",
        "x1",
        "y1",
        "x2",
        "y2",
        "application",
        "force",
        "direction",
        "location"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "pile"
        },
        "x1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "x2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "application": {
          "enum": [
            "active",
            "passive"
          ]
        },
        "force": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "spacing": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "direction": {
          "enum": [
            "angle",
            "tangent",
            "perpendicular"
          ]
        },
        "angle": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "exclusiveMinimum": -90,
          "exclusiveMaximum": 90
        },
        "location": {
          "enum": [
            "slip_surface",
            "centroid"
          ]
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "direction": {
                "const": "angle"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "angle"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "angle": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "angle": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "sheet_pile": {
      "description": "sheet_pile (F4.2): tablestaca, una fila continua de pilotes; force es la fuerza de corte por metro de muro, sin spacing. Es vertical: x1 = x2 (solo lo valida el motor). direction, angle y location como en pile.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "type",
        "x1",
        "y1",
        "x2",
        "y2",
        "application",
        "force",
        "direction",
        "location"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "sheet_pile"
        },
        "x1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y1": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "x2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y2": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "application": {
          "enum": [
            "active",
            "passive"
          ]
        },
        "force": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "direction": {
          "enum": [
            "angle",
            "tangent",
            "perpendicular"
          ]
        },
        "angle": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "exclusiveMinimum": -90,
          "exclusiveMaximum": 90
        },
        "location": {
          "enum": [
            "slip_surface",
            "centroid"
          ]
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "direction": {
                "const": "angle"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "angle"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "angle": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "angle": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "pullout": {
      "description": "Modelo de arrancamiento (F4.2), etiquetado por model. bond: strength (fuerza por metro de elemento, ≥ 0) y bonded_length opcional (> 0 y ≤ longitud, esto último solo lo valida el motor; la adherencia solo actúa en los últimos metros hacia la punta). interface: adhesion ≥ 0, friction_angle en [0, 90), coverage en (0, 1]. development: length1 y length2 ≥ 0. Sin pullout, el elemento está totalmente anclado en ambos extremos.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "model",
            "strength"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "model": {
              "const": "bond"
            },
            "strength": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "bonded_length": {
              "type": [
                "number",
                "null"
              ],
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "model",
            "adhesion",
            "friction_angle",
            "coverage"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "model": {
              "const": "interface"
            },
            "adhesion": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "friction_angle": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "exclusiveMaximum": 90
            },
            "coverage": {
              "type": "number",
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "model",
            "length1",
            "length2"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "model": {
              "const": "development"
            },
            "length1": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "length2": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "seismic": {
      "description": "Coeficientes pseudoestáticos (solo version 0.2). kh·W actúa en el sentido del deslizamiento; con kv > 0, kv·W actúa hacia abajo. Se aplican solo al peso del suelo, nunca a las cargas.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "kh": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0,
          "exclusiveMaximum": 1,
          "default": 0
        },
        "kv": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": -1,
          "exclusiveMaximum": 1,
          "default": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "slope": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "direction": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "auto",
            "left_to_right",
            "right_to_left"
          ],
          "default": "auto"
        }
      }
    },
    "analysis": {
      "description": "Debe haber superficie fija o búsqueda (no nulas): sin ellas el motor responde NoSurface.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "required": [
            "surface"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "surface": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "required": [
            "search"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "search": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "allOf": [
        {
          "description": "interslice solo con morgenstern_price en methods (F3.4).",
          "if": {
            "required": [
              "interslice"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "interslice": {
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "methods": {
                "contains": {
                  "const": "morgenstern_price"
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "methods"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Bishop no admite una polilínea (F3.6), y sin methods el valor por defecto es [\"bishop\"]: una polilínea fija exige methods (E13l-8). Con analysis.search, la superficie fija se ignora y la regla no aplica.",
          "if": {
            "required": [
              "surface"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "surface": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "type"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "type": {
                    "const": "polyline"
                  }
                }
              },
              "search": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "methods": {
                "items": {
                  "not": {
                    "const": "bishop"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "methods"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "methods": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "bishop",
              "spencer",
              "morgenstern_price",
              "janbu_simplified",
              "janbu_corrected"
            ]
          },
          "default": [
            "bishop"
          ]
        },
        "slices": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 3,
          "maximum": 2000,
          "default": 50
        },
        "tolerance": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 0.01,
          "default": 1e-05
        },
        "max_iterations": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 100000,
          "default": 500
        },
        "min_m_alpha": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1,
          "default": 0.2
        },
        "seismic": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/seismic"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "interslice": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/interslice"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "surface": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/surface"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "search": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/search"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "surface": {
      "description": "Superficie fija. Se ignora si existe analysis.search. El círculo es de toda versión; la polilínea exige version 0.3.",
      "type": "object",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/surface_circle"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/surface_polyline"
        }
      ]
    },
    "surface_circle": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "type",
        "xc",
        "yc",
        "r"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "circle"
        },
        "xc": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "yc": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "r": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "surface_polyline": {
      "description": "Polilínea fija (version 0.3): al menos 2 puntos con x estrictamente creciente (el motor lo valida). Se ajusta al terreno prolongando o recortando sus extremos.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "type",
        "points"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "polyline"
        },
        "points": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/polyline"
        }
      }
    },
    "interslice": {
      "description": "Función de las fuerzas entre dovelas de morgenstern_price (version 0.3, F3.4). points [[ξ, f], …] solo con data_points, y es obligatorio con ella; el motor valida ξ estrictamente creciente de 0 a 1, f ≥ 0 y algún f > 0.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "function"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "function": {
          "enum": [
            "constant",
            "half_sine",
            "clipped_sine",
            "trapezoidal",
            "data_points"
          ]
        },
        "points": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/polyline"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "function": {
                "const": "data_points"
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "required": [
              "points"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "points": {
                "type": "array"
              }
            }
          },
          "else": {
            "properties": {
              "points": {
                "type": "null"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "search": {
      "description": "Búsqueda circular entrada-salida. Si existe, reemplaza a analysis.surface.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "circular_entry_exit"
        },
        "entry": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/range"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "exit": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/range"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "n_entry": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 200,
          "default": 20
        },
        "n_exit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 200,
          "default": 20
        },
        "n_radius": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 200,
          "default": 20
        },
        "max_radius_factor": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0.51,
          "default": 5.0
        },
        "min_width": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "refine": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        }
      }
    }
  }
